  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: La Rustica</p>\r\n<p>The site of La Rustica derives its name from a Medieval estate that was situated between the river Anio and the\u00a0fosso di Tor Sapienza. Archaeological research at the site in 1972 revealed a large necropolis.</p>",
